# Build & Release Rules

## Before Building

1. Confirm you are on the correct branch (`git branch --show-current`).
2. Confirm the version is correct (`grep '"version"' package.json`).
3. Ensure working tree is clean (`git status`).

## Build Commands

- **Desktop app:** `npx tauri build` (requires Rust toolchain)
- **Web only:** `npm run build`
- **Dev mode:** `npm run dev` (web) or `npm run tauri:dev` (desktop)

## After Building Desktop

- `.app` is at `src-tauri/target/release/bundle/macos/RedfireForge.app`
- `.dmg` is at `src-tauri/target/release/bundle/dmg/`
- DMG filename includes the version: `RedfireForge_X.Y.Z_aarch64.dmg`

## Distributing

- Share the `.dmg` file for macOS coworkers
- For stable releases on `master`, create a git tag: `git tag vX.Y.Z`

## Changelog

When releasing any version, update `CHANGELOG.md`:
- Move items from `[Unreleased]` into a new `## [X.Y.Z] — YYYY-MM-DD` section
- Use categories: Added, Changed, Fixed, Removed
